  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Livity Project: Supporting Eastern Caribbean CSOs for Social Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The project is designed to address marginalisation, discrimination and exclusion of persons with disabilities, LGBTI Caribbean citizens, women, youth and the elderly in national and regional decision-making processes. It proposes to do this through five work packages that are designed to support CSOs to improve their knowledgebase, to foster their professionalisation, and to ensure institutional strengthening and capacity building toward securing policy and legislative reform.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
